  "steps": [
    "Microwave 1 serve (50g) Yogabar’s Protein Oats and 250 ml low fat milk for 3 minutes. Then add fresh strawberries (mashed a bit) along with chunks of apple toasted in 1 tsp of butter, cinnamon and some zero calorie sugar. Top with the apples and pumpkin seeds. You can also add whey protein 1 scoop to double the protein qty."
